# FREE African Drumming classes this week! NEW term starts

# TODAY!!

Hi everyone,

Hope you are all well and are feeling refreshed and rejuvenated after the holidays! We have our NEW term of classes beginning this week in Maleny and Palmwoods. **We are offering this whole week of classes for FREE** and we would absolutely love you to join us on a new set of exciting rhythms!

For our Maleny students we now have a NEW winter time with the class beginning on Mondays at 5.15-6.15 pm @ The Bliss Centre, next to the library. We are hoping that this NEW time will entice **after school activity Maleny** students for ages 8+ and also the general public with earlier, warmer hours! The NEW space in Maleny is absolutely divine with **NEW carpets, heaters and a delicious meditative, community vibe!**

A massive warm welcome back to old students, new students and to anyone that has come along once or twice! We hope you can all come and enjoy African Drumming for FREE this week! Nathaniel will be providing students with information on exciting upcoming events and some **special offers** for future class bookings.

Don't forget that  Bassidi Koné arrives this week and we have loads of exciting events coming up this weekend with performances and workshops from Noosa to the Gold Coast! Don't forget to reserve a place for the workshop in Palmwoods and contact Cafe Le Monde, Noosa for table bookings to see Bassidi and Nathaniel in performance 6pm on Friday evening.

This performance will be absolutely phenomenal!

For more information see our website or events section in Facebook.

[https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ)

[/drumming-workshops/bassidi-kone-drumming-workshops-sunshine-coast/](/drumming-workshops/bassidi-kone-drumming-workshops-sunshine-coast/)

We look forward to seeing you again in class this week!

Thanks,

Bec :)
